  "limitations": [
    "The devices used in psychophysiological measurements collected a large amount of raw data, making meaningful inferences difficult for researchers.",
    "Exposure to all types of external stimuli in real-life settings prevented the collection of accurate data about human experience.",
    "Most experimental studies were conducted in contrived settings (laboratories, VR studios), which are not wholly adequate for thoroughly understanding human experience.",
    "The concepts presented in theoretical studies and examined in experimental studies do not match.",
    "The findings of the experimental studies remain isolated as further experiments face challenges in measuring and associating the data."
  ],
